Rails Agents is mounted at /agents.

Next steps:

  1. Start your app and open http://localhost:3000/agents
  2. Sign up — the engine handshakes with https://meerkatagents.com
     and writes config/rails_agents_credentials.yml
  3. Or run: rails-agents login
  4. Create an agent in the dashboard (vibe-code with Kip)
  5. Test in the sandbox, then Deploy (Studio for production)

Optional .env placeholders:

  RAILS_AGENTS_API_KEY=
  RAILS_AGENTS_PROJECT_ID=
  RAILS_AGENTS_API_BASE=https://meerkatagents.com
  RAILS_AGENTS_DASHBOARD_BASE=https://meerkatagents.com

Docs: https://meerkatagents.com/docs/getting-started
